# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [Unreleased]

### Added

- Add host-debug, host-sanitizer, ESP32-C3, and STM32 compile-only CMake presets.
- Add the platform-neutral application core and Catch2 tests for navigation, command versioning,
  duplicate command suppression, and status-view replay.
- Document the current architecture, event catalog, STRIDE threat model, and architecture
  decisions.

### Changed

- Pin QP/C++ to a specific upstream commit and use statically allocated QP task storage.
- Use fixed-size configuration text buffers and clear moved-from secret buffers.

### Known limitations

- The local ESP-IDF development version and `dependencies.lock` version differ; production toolchain
  qualification remains blocked.
- Remote service, durable event storage, atomic configuration persistence, authenticated OTA,
  secure boot/encryption provisioning, Wokwi CI, and full static-analysis coverage are incomplete.
